#       could not map.
#
#       Filled by hand (DESIGN.md §3.6, the stand-ins; region p2s): before luce-js the typed
#       arrays LibWeb makes natively are Uint8Arrays (the chunks of byte streams), cells viewing
#       an ArrayBuffer with a fixed length. TypedArrayBase holds what every kind has; the kind
#       is Uint8Array's (element size 1) until phase 3 brings the others. The class shares
#       JS::Cell's class id until the generator numbers it; it is recognized by its ClassInfo.
#
